{"id":"u44","kelas":12,"no":3,"judul":"Wawancara Kerja","title":"Job Interview","emoji":"🤝","ringkas":"Ungkapan dan percakapan untuk wawancara","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali tahapan **job interview**: salam, perkenalan, pertanyaan inti, dan penutup","menjawab pertanyaan umum: [[Tell me about yourself.]], [[Why do you want this job?]], [[What are your strengths?]]","memakai ungkapan sopan dan profesional dalam wawancara","menceritakan pengalaman dan kemampuan dengan **simple past** dan **present perfect**","mengajukan pertanyaan kepada pewawancara","berlatih dialog wawancara kerja dari awal sampai akhir"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Setelah surat lamaran diterima, langkah berikutnya adalah **wawancara kerja** (*job interview*). Pewawancara ingin tahu siapa kamu, apa kemampuanmu, dan mengapa kamu cocok. Dengan latihan, jawaban yang **jelas, jujur, dan sopan** akan membuatmu percaya diri."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Tahapan wawancara","table":[["Tahap","Contoh ungkapan"],["**Salam**","[[Good morning. Thank you for seeing me.]]"],["**Perkenalan**","[[Please tell me about yourself.]] / [[My name is Dina Putri.]]"],["**Pertanyaan inti**","[[Why do you want to work here?]]"],["**Pertanyaan balik**","[[Could you tell me more about the job?]]"],["**Penutup**","[[Thank you for your time. I look forward to hearing from you.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Pertanyaan umum dan cara menjawab","table":[["Pertanyaan","Contoh jawaban"],["[[Tell me about yourself.]]","[[I graduated from SMK Negeri 1 in 2025. I enjoy working with people.]]"],["[[Why do you want this job?]]","[[I want to learn and use my skills in a professional team.]]"],["[[What are your strengths?]]","[[I am responsible, punctual, and a quick learner.]]"],["[[What are your weaknesses?]]","[[Sometimes I am too careful, but I am learning to work faster.]]"],["[[Do you have any experience?]]","[[Yes, I did an internship at a travel agency for three months.]]"],["[[Can you work under pressure?]]","[[Yes, I can. I stay calm and make a plan.]]"],["[[Where do you see yourself in five years?]]","[[I hope to become a skilled and trusted employee.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"interviewer","id":"pewawancara","ex":"The interviewer asked many questions."},{"en":"interviewee","id":"orang yang diwawancarai","ex":"The interviewee answered politely."},{"en":"strength","id":"kekuatan / kelebihan","ex":"Teamwork is my strength."},{"en":"weakness","id":"kelemahan","ex":"My weakness is shyness."},{"en":"punctual","id":"tepat waktu","ex":"She is always punctual."},{"en":"quick learner","id":"cepat belajar","ex":"I am a quick learner."},{"en":"team player","id":"pemain tim / kerja sama","ex":"He is a good team player."},{"en":"salary","id":"gaji","ex":"What is the salary for this position?"},{"en":"working hours","id":"jam kerja","ex":"The working hours are 8 to 4."},{"en":"full-time / part-time","id":"penuh waktu / paruh waktu","ex":"I want a part-time job."},{"en":"probation","id":"masa percobaan","ex":"The probation period is three months."},{"en":"deal with","id":"menangani","ex":"I can deal with customers."},{"en":"handle","id":"menangani","ex":"She can handle many tasks."},{"en":"achievement","id":"pencapaian","ex":"My achievement was winning a contest."},{"en":"train","id":"melatih / pelatihan","ex":"The company will train new staff."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Ungkapan sopan dan profesional","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menjawab sopan","[[Yes, certainly.]] / [[I would be happy to.]]"],["Meminta mengulang","[[Could you repeat the question, please?]] / [[I'm sorry, could you say that again?]]"],["Berpikir sejenak","[[Let me think for a moment.]]"],["Menyatakan kemampuan","[[I am able to ...]] / [[I am good at ...]] / [[I can ...]]"],["Menyatakan pengalaman","[[I have worked as ... for ...]] / [[I was responsible for ...]]"],["Bertanya balik","[[What are the working hours?]] / [[Is there any training?]]"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for the opportunity.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Hindari jawaban kasual dan berlebihan","text":"Jangan jawab dengan [[Yeah]], [[Nope]], atau [[Whatever]]. Gunakan [[Yes]], [[No]], [[Certainly]]. Jangan berbohong dan jangan menjelekkan tempat kerja lama. Jawab singkat, jelas, disertai **contoh**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Tense yang dipakai","table":[["Tense","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**Simple present**","sifat, kemampuan","[[I am responsible.]] / [[I speak English well.]]"],["**Simple past**","pengalaman yang sudah selesai","[[I worked at a cafe last year.]]"],["**Present perfect**","pengalaman sampai sekarang","[[I have learned to use Excel.]]"],["**Future (will)**","komitmen","[[I will do my best.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Wawancara kerja","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Good morning, Dina. Please have a seat.","id":"Selamat pagi, Dina. Silakan duduk."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Good morning, Mr. Adi. Thank you for seeing me.","id":"Selamat pagi, Pak Adi. Terima kasih sudah menerima saya."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Tell me about yourself.","id":"Ceritakan tentang dirimu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"I graduated from SMK Negeri 1 Bandung in 2025. I did an internship at a travel agency for three months, and I enjoy working with people.","id":"Saya lulus dari SMK Negeri 1 Bandung tahun 2025. Saya magang di biro perjalanan selama tiga bulan, dan saya senang bekerja dengan orang."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Why do you want to work here?","id":"Mengapa kamu ingin bekerja di sini?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Because your company is well known for good service, and I want to learn from a professional team.","id":"Karena perusahaan Anda terkenal dengan pelayanan yang baik, dan saya ingin belajar dari tim profesional."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"What are your strengths?","id":"Apa kelebihanmu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I am responsible, punctual, and a quick learner.","id":"Saya bertanggung jawab, tepat waktu, dan cepat belajar."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Pertanyaan dan penutup","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Do you have any questions for me?","id":"Apakah kamu punya pertanyaan untuk saya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes. What are the working hours, and is there any training for new staff?","id":"Ya. Berapa jam kerjanya, dan apakah ada pelatihan untuk staf baru?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"The working hours are from eight to four, and we train new staff for two weeks.","id":"Jam kerjanya pukul delapan sampai empat, dan kami melatih staf baru selama dua minggu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Thank you for your time. I look forward to hearing from you.","id":"Terima kasih atas waktu Anda. Saya menantikan kabar dari Anda."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"We will contact you next week.","id":"Kami akan menghubungimu minggu depan."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Persiapan wawancara","text":"Pelajari perusahaan, latih jawaban untuk pertanyaan umum, datang **tepat waktu**, berpakaian rapi, tersenyum, dan lihat mata pewawancara. Gunakan pola **jawaban + contoh**: [[I am responsible. For example, I finished every task on time during my internship.]]"},{"t":"summary","items":["Tahapan: salam, perkenalan, pertanyaan inti, bertanya balik, penutup.","Pertanyaan umum: [[Tell me about yourself.]], [[Why do you want this job?]], [[What are your strengths?]]","Jawab dengan **jelas, jujur, sopan**, sertakan contoh nyata.","Tense: simple present (sifat), simple past (pengalaman), present perfect (sampai sekarang), will (komitmen).","Akhiri dengan [[Thank you for your time.]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["interviewer","pewawancara"],["strength","kelebihan"],["weakness","kelemahan"],["salary","gaji"],["punctual","tepat waktu"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar wawancara.","k":"2b89570e"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["part-time","paruh waktu"],["working hours","jam kerja"],["probation","masa percobaan"],["achievement","pencapaian"]],"exp":"Kosakata wawancara.","k":"2bf038fc"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan pertanyaan dengan jawaban yang cocok:","pairs":[["What are your strengths?","I am responsible and punctual."],["Do you have any experience?","Yes, I did an internship."],["Why do you want this job?","I want to learn from a professional team."]],"exp":"Jawaban yang sesuai.","k":"0c5c246c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pertanyaan pembuka yang paling umum dalam wawancara adalah...","options":["Tell me about yourself.","Where is the toilet?","How old is your cat?","What is for lunch?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Pembuka wawancara.","k":"d8532ad0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang paling sopan untuk \"Can you work under pressure?\" adalah...","options":["Yes, I can. I stay calm and make a plan.","Nope.","Whatever.","I don't know."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan dan beralasan.","k":"bd85cc46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jika tidak mendengar pertanyaan, kamu sebaiknya berkata...","options":["Could you repeat the question, please?","What?","Huh?","Say it again!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan meminta mengulang.","k":"7d7508f5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk meminta waktu berpikir adalah...","options":["Let me think for a moment.","I don't care.","That's silly.","Next question!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Berpikir sejenak.","k":"610f62bb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang tepat untuk menunjukkan kemampuan adalah...","options":["I am good at solving problems.","I am bad at everything.","I sleep all day.","I never work."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kemampuan positif.","k":"222a2403"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pertanyaan yang pantas diajukan kepada pewawancara adalah...","options":["What are the working hours?","Do you have a girlfriend?","How much is your car?","Can I sleep here?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Pertanyaan profesional.","k":"3ced77f3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat penutup wawancara yang sopan adalah...","options":["Thank you for the opportunity.","Bye bye!","See you, dude.","Hope you're fine."],"answer":0,"exp":"Berterima kasih.","k":"7961d96e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang tepat: \"I ___ an internship last year.\"","options":["did","do","will do","am doing"],"answer":0,"exp":"last year → simple past.","k":"63a99281"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang tepat: \"I ___ worked as a waiter for two years.\"","options":["have","had","am","will"],"answer":0,"exp":"for two years → present perfect.","k":"095be918"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sebaiknya dihindari saat wawancara?","options":["menjelekkan tempat kerja lama","datang tepat waktu","tersenyum","menjawab jujur"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak profesional.","k":"74f88567"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"I am a quick learner.\" Artinya...","options":["saya cepat belajar","saya cepat marah","saya suka bicara","saya lambat"],"answer":0,"exp":"quick learner = cepat belajar.","k":"32767db3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ceritakan tentang dirimu.","q":"Tell me about ___.","answers":["yourself"],"hint":"dirimu","exp":"yourself.","k":"41405870"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya bertanggung jawab dan tepat waktu.","q":"I am responsible and ___.","answers":["punctual"],"hint":"tepat waktu","exp":"punctual.","k":"27fcf23e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas waktu Anda.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["time"],"hint":"waktu","exp":"Thank you for your time.","k":"5c4b3e59"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan berusaha sebaik mungkin.","q":"I will do my ___.","answers":["best"],"hint":"terbaik","exp":"do my best.","k":"c8907d10"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya menantikan kabar dari Anda.","q":"I look ___ to hearing from you.","answers":["forward"],"hint":"ke depan","exp":"look forward to.","k":"b094252c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya baik dalam menyelesaikan masalah.","q":"I am good ___ solving problems.","answers":["at"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"good at.","k":"08702df5"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Mengapa Anda ingin bekerja di sini?\"","answer":"Why do you want to work here?","exp":"Why do you want to + V1?","k":"02964587"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya magang selama tiga bulan.\"","answer":"I did an internship for three months.","exp":"did + for + durasi.","k":"5544750d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Tell me about yourself","options":["Ceritakan tentang dirimu","Aku tidak tahu dirimu","Kamu lupa namamu","Siapa temanmu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tell me about yourself.","k":"dece3d7d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"What are your strengths and weaknesses","options":["Apa kelebihan dan kelemahanmu","Apa makanan favoritmu","Kapan kamu lulus","Di mana rumahmu"],"answer":0,"exp":"strengths and weaknesses.","k":"e161b329"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I am a quick learner and a good team player","options":["Saya cepat belajar dan pemain tim yang baik","Saya pemain bola cepat","Saya guru yang baik","Saya tidak suka tim"],"answer":0,"exp":"quick learner = cepat belajar.","k":"d82ab41d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya bisa bekerja dalam tim.","q":"I can work ___ a team.","answers":["in"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"work in a team.","k":"f7996779"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya bertanggung jawab atas laporan keuangan.","q":"I was responsible ___ the reports.","answers":["for"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"responsible for.","k":"50d3191f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya senang bekerja dengan orang.","q":"I enjoy ___ with people. (work)","answers":["working"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"enjoy + V-ing.","k":"d65777a0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya sudah belajar memakai Excel.","q":"I have ___ to use Excel. (learn)","answers":["learned","learnt"],"hint":"V3","exp":"have + V3.","k":"f71b3d36"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya berharap menjadi karyawan yang terampil.","q":"I hope to ___ a skilled employee. (become)","answers":["become"],"hint":"menjadi","exp":"hope to + V1.","k":"ab981778"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah Anda punya pengalaman?","q":"Do you have any ___?","answers":["experience"],"hint":"pengalaman","exp":"experience.","k":"b0fc955b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan memulai kapan saja.","q":"I can start at any ___.","answers":["time"],"hint":"waktu","exp":"at any time.","k":"5a54fa56"},{"type":"fill","id":"Perusahaan akan melatih staf baru.","q":"The company will ___ new staff.","answers":["train"],"hint":"melatih","exp":"train.","k":"51a58349"},{"type":"fill","id":"Masa percobaan berlangsung tiga bulan.","q":"The ___ period is three months.","answers":["probation"],"hint":"percobaan","exp":"probation.","k":"9324422d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berapa gaji untuk posisi ini?","q":"What is the ___ for this position?","answers":["salary"],"hint":"gaji","exp":"salary.","k":"cc2000d7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia pemain tim yang baik.","q":"He is a good team ___.","answers":["player"],"hint":"pemain","exp":"team player.","k":"b1705cbc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban terbaik untuk \"Why should we hire you?\" adalah...","options":["I have the skills and I am willing to learn.","Because I need money.","Because I'm bored.","I don't know."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menonjolkan kemampuan.","k":"5b62d9d5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban terbaik untuk \"Where do you see yourself in five years?\"","options":["I hope to grow and take more responsibility.","At the beach.","I will be your boss.","Sleeping."],"answer":0,"exp":"Realistis dan positif.","k":"cba8c529"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menunjukkan pengalaman?","options":["I worked as a cashier for one year.","I like pizza.","I am tall.","I have a cat."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pengalaman kerja.","k":"83f7a72b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menunjukkan kelebihan?","options":["I am a quick learner.","I am always late.","I hate people.","I cannot work."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kelebihan.","k":"3c8d2855"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menjawab yang baik adalah...","options":["jelas, singkat, dan disertai contoh","sangat panjang","diam saja","mengubah topik"],"answer":0,"exp":"Efektif.","k":"cb8c1a25"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang tepat: \"I ___ at a cafe for two years.\"","options":["have worked","work","will work","am work"],"answer":0,"exp":"for two years → present perfect.","k":"6f4bdc91"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["I am interested in this position.","I am interest in this position.","I interested this position.","I am interesting in this position."],"answer":0,"exp":"interested in.","k":"50edeef6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["I look forward to working with your team.","I look forward to work with your team.","I look forward working with your team.","I looking forward to working."],"answer":0,"exp":"look forward to + V-ing.","k":"651aad72"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"handle\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["menangani","menolak","menunda","menjual"],"answer":0,"exp":"handle = deal with.","k":"f80c08c7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"deal with\" artinya...","options":["menangani","membagi kartu","menjual","membayar"],"answer":0,"exp":"deal with = menangani.","k":"cb117289"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"achievement\" artinya...","options":["pencapaian","kegagalan","pertemanan","pertandingan"],"answer":0,"exp":"achievement.","k":"a5a752ad"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya cepat belajar dan bertanggung jawab.\"","answer":"I am a quick learner and responsible.","exp":"I am ... and ...","k":"1f0daac4"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan lawan kata:","pairs":[["strength","weakness"],["full-time","part-time"],["punctual","late"],["hire","dismiss"]],"exp":"Lawan kata.","k":"1848661b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I am able to work under pressure","options":["Saya mampu bekerja di bawah tekanan","Saya tidak mau bekerja","Saya bekerja kemarin","Saya bekerja di bank"],"answer":0,"exp":"under pressure = di bawah tekanan.","k":"5b79b147"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"What are the working hours","options":["Berapa jam kerjanya","Di mana kantornya","Siapa atasannya","Kapan libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"working hours = jam kerja.","k":"ecdb0f6a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ceritakan tentang diri Anda.","q":"Tell me ___ yourself.","answers":["about"],"hint":"tentang","exp":"about.","k":"2e41024c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apa kelebihan Anda?","q":"What are your ___?","answers":["strengths"],"hint":"kelebihan","exp":"strengths.","k":"7e9cb4b2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apa kelemahan Anda?","q":"What is your biggest ___?","answers":["weakness"],"hint":"kelemahan","exp":"weakness.","k":"71cc7fc3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mengapa Anda ingin bekerja di sini?","q":"Why do you want to ___ here?","answers":["work"],"hint":"bekerja","exp":"work.","k":"f59da6f3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya bisa belajar dengan cepat.","q":"I can learn ___.","answers":["quickly","fast"],"hint":"cepat","exp":"quickly.","k":"a1dc931a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya senang bekerja dalam tim.","q":"I enjoy working ___ a team.","answers":["in"],"hint":"kata depan","exp":"in a team.","k":"ad45312e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya punya pengalaman di bidang penjualan.","q":"I have experience ___ sales.","answers":["in"],"hint":"kata depan","exp":"experience in.","k":"9752516f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dalam lima tahun, saya ingin menjadi manajer.","q":"In five years, I ___ to become a manager.","answers":["want","hope","would like"],"hint":"ingin","exp":"want.","k":"753d4776"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban terbaik untuk \"Tell me about yourself\":","options":["Ringkasan pendidikan, pengalaman, dan tujuan","Seluruh riwayat keluarga","Keluhan tentang mantan bos","Satu kata saja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ringkas dan relevan.","k":"42b9169f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pakaian untuk wawancara kerja:","options":["rapi dan sopan","piyama","pakaian pantai","kaos robek"],"answer":0,"exp":"Rapi.","k":"4f4e6cde"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Sebaiknya datang wawancara...","options":["10-15 menit lebih awal","30 menit terlambat","tepat saat selesai","besok"],"answer":0,"exp":"Lebih awal.","k":"cc1da323"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang sopan di akhir wawancara?","options":["It was a pleasure to meet you.","Bye.","Finally done.","Call me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"7b8b4f43"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Strength\" artinya...","options":["kekuatan/kelebihan","kelemahan","ancaman","k